  "about": {
    "id": "about",
    "eyebrow": "01 · About",
    "heading": "From the factory floor to the frontend.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Before I wrote code for a living, I spent four years running packaging machines and leading shifts at PT Oji Sinarmas. That's where I learned to think in systems: how the parts move, where the load really sits, and what breaks first under pressure.",
      "At Formulatrix I brought that mindset to React: real-time dashboards for lab robots, a component library shared across product teams, and internal tools people use every day.",
      "Now I'm going deeper into backend and systems work with NestJS, Prisma and PostgreSQL, and tinkering with Linux and embedded hardware on the side."
